#% title
# pairwise_density_histogram

#% text
# `pairwise_density_histogram(data)` draws a grid of panels with the counts of each pair of columns binned in squares as colours.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# The diagonal shows each column's histogram.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
pairwise_density_histogram(table([sin(k), cos(2 * k), k / 50], k, range(1, 200)))
